{"id":"8cea21e174a04417","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-partial-compatibility.md","title":"偏函数的相容与扩张","display":"df-partial-compatibility — 偏函数的相容与扩张","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-partial-compatibility","aliases":["20-df-partial-compatibility"],"display":"df-partial-compatibility — 偏函数的相容与扩张","chapter":"6","section":"6.5","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Definition 6.5.8","source_printed_pages":[142],"source_pdf_pages":[176],"depends_on":["[[20-df-partial-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-partial-compatibility"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-partial-compatibility</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-partial-compatibility — 偏函数的相容与扩张"},{"key":"chapter","html":"6"},{"key":"section","html":"6.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 6.5.8"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>142</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>176</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3f7915f8f8ad037c\" href=\"?note=3f7915f8f8ad037c\" title=\"20-df-partial-function\">20-df-partial-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g:\\omega\\rightharpoonup\\{0,1\\}\">\\(f,g:\\omega\\rightharpoonup\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 为偏函数；作为函数图使用包含与并。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3f7915f8f8ad037c\" href=\"?note=3f7915f8f8ad037c\" title=\"20-df-partial-function\">20-df-partial-function</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}compatibility}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Compat}(f,g)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(g)\\ [f(x)=g(x)],\\\\\nf\\sqsubseteq g\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow f\\subseteq g,\n\\qquad\\operatorname{Compat}(f,g)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists h:\\omega\\rightharpoonup\\{0,1\\}\\ [f\\sqsubseteq h\\land g\\sqsubseteq h].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}compatibility}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Compat}(f,g)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(g)\\ [f(x)=g(x)],\\\\\nf\\sqsubseteq g\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow f\\subseteq g,\n\\qquad\\operatorname{Compat}(f,g)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists h:\\omega\\rightharpoonup\\{0,1\\}\\ [f\\sqsubseteq h\\land g\\sqsubseteq h].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>相容时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\cup g\">\\(f\\cup g\\)</span> 就是共同偏函数扩张；有公共扩张时相交定义域上的值必相同。此签名允许无限定义域，不能以两个有限串的前缀可比性代替。有限二进制串自然视为这类偏函数；对其而言相容恰等价于前缀可比。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 6.5.8；印刷页 142；PDF 第 176 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"3f7915f8f8ad037c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-partial-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"3f7915f8f8ad037c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-partial-function]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f,g:\\omega\\rightharpoonup\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}compatibility}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Compat}(f,g)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(g)\\ [f(x)=g(x)],\\\\\nf\\sqsubseteq g\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow f\\subseteq g,\n\\qquad\\operatorname{Compat}(f,g)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists h:\\omega\\rightharpoonup\\{0,1\\}\\ [f\\sqsubseteq h\\land g\\sqsubseteq h].\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"f\\cup g","display":false}],"bytes":1515,"backlinks":[{"id":"ff58133a4b24edeb","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-partial-compatibility]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；see [[20-df-tred]]；see [[20-df-strings]]。"},{"id":"6330178076c4520f","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-partial-compatibility]]；see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-relative-ce]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-thm-relative-limit]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-thm-jump]]。"},{"id":"f1ca4420af66074c","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-exact-pair]]；see [[20-df-column-thickness]]；see [[20-df-partial-compatibility]]；see [[20-lem-compatible-cross-search]]；see [[20-df-join]]；see [[20-df-deg]]。"}],"outgoing":["3f7915f8f8ad037c"]}